  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Jacket Features</h2>\n<p>The jacket is described as having a unique design with detachable hoods, allowing for customization. The hoods are fluffy and fuzzy, adding to the jacket&#x27;s comfort and style. The jacket also features multiple pockets, including a strap that doesn&#x27;t fit, which may be a design quirk or an intentional feature for added functionality.</p>\n<p>The jacket can be worn with arms free, similar to how anime characters are often depicted. This feature allows for a more dynamic and stylish look, and it is highlighted as being cooler than a cape. The secret to achieving this look involves using straps in the armpits, which help secure the jacket in place while allowing for freedom of movement.</p>\n<p>The jacket is also noted for its ability to protect against wind gusts, making it suitable for outdoor activities. The speaker demonstrates how to wear the jacket correctly, emphasizing the importance of using the straps and adjusting the fit for optimal comfort and style.</p>\n<p>The jacket is described as having embroidered straps, similar to those found on a good-sized jacket. This detail adds to the jacket&#x27;s aesthetic appeal and may indicate a higher level of craftsmanship.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=88KKEzARyyw</p>",
